      "<p>Saturday</p>\r\n",
      "<p>Friday</p>\r\n",
      "<p>Wednesday</p>\r\n"
    ],
    "correct": 3,
    "solution": "<p>The correct answer is <strong>option 3</strong> i.e.&nbsp;<strong>Friday.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>On 31st December, 2005 it was Saturday.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Number of odd days from the year 2006 to the year 2009 = (1 + 1 + 2 + 1) = 5 days.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;On 31st December 2009, it was Thursday.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Thus, on 1st Jan, 2010 it is Friday.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "marks": "2",
